 "lines": [
  "Stop taking three touches before you shoot.",
  "I broke down Paulo Dybala's shooting. Four habits to copy.",
  "He's not big or strong. He's just quicker to the shot.",
  "One. He shoots fast.",
  "First time, or two touches max. Before the defender can close him.",
  "Two. He doesn't get stuck on one corner.",
  "Near post, far post, high, low. The keeper can't guess.",
  "Three. Every time a teammate shoots, he runs in.",
  "If the keeper spills it, he's first to the rebound.",
  "Four. He doesn't dribble to beat players.",
  "He dribbles to pull defenders in. Then he finds the runner.",
  "So next game, one touch to set it. Then shoot.",
  "Follow for the next one. The free analysis test is in my bio."
 ],
